     gives you that right regardless of this licence.

3. Ownership
   FontVault, including its source code, design and name, belongs to the copyright
   holder. Using or testing it, alone or within a company or team, does not give you,
   your employer or your clients any ownership of, or rights in, FontVault beyond the
   evaluation use described above.

4. Feedback
   If you send suggestions, bug reports or other feedback, the copyright holder may use
