7. No warranty
   FontVault is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. To the extent the law
   allows, the copyright holder is not liable for any loss or damage arising from its
   use, including loss of data or fonts. Keep backups.

8. Ending
   The copyright holder may end this permission at any time. If that happens, stop
   using FontVault and delete your copies.
